      "content": "idk if a small step is even gonna matter. it just feels like i'm decorating a prison cell. no matter how much i try to \"climb out,\" the walls are always there. it's just this endless, heavy loop of guilt and craving and failing. i'm just so tired of the fight. i'm tired of being the person who keeps failing.",
